* [http://www.lojban.org/lists/jboske|jboske, the list for technical discussions of Lojban] [http://www.storeingame.com/level/World-of-Warcraft-EU/power-leveling|WOW Power Leveling]
* [http://www.lojban.org/lists/bpfk-announce|The BPFK announcement list] [http://www.2joygame.com|Lotro Gold]
The Google Groups lists should have complete, searchable archives stored in Google Groups itself.

In addition to this, for research purposes, there are as-complete-as-humanly-possible archives of all Google Groups lists stored as UNIX mail files on one of the lojban.org computers.  If you need access to them, [mailto:secretary@lojban.org|mail the LLG secretary].

!!!IRC Logs

[/resources/irclog/|public logs of the lojbanic portions of the IRC channel][http://www.gobuycheaprsgold.com|RS Gold]are available. 

__Note:__ the logs are filtered so that they contain only lojbanic text. However, you might still be offended by the things discussed there. If you are, that's your problem, and the ((LLG))[http://www.storeingame.com|WOW Gold] explicitly disclaims responsibility for anything said on the IRC channel, including by members or officers of the ((LLG))[http://www.zyy.com|Buy WOW Gold].Furthermore, no guarantee is made as to the correctness of the Lojban therein.
